{"pageid":3416,"title":"Under the map.","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Under the map.</span>","revid":18401,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><big><b>How to get under the map</b></big>\n</p><p>to get under the map either it can happen by a spawn bug or it can happen from the owner of a property leaving while someone is in their basement \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Under-map_textures\">Under-map textures</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b7/Under_the_map_light.png/revision/latest?cb=20241019004055\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Under the map normally\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b7/Under_the_map_light.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241019004055\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Under the map light.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_the_map_light.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Under_the_map_light.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Under the map normally</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Under_the_map_magma.png/revision/latest?cb=20241019004227\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Under the map near magma cave\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Under_the_map_magma.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241019004227\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Under the map magma.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_the_map_magma.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Under_the_map_magma.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Under the map near magma cave</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/RobloxScreenShot20241018_174444217.png/revision/latest?cb=20241019004500\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Under the map sky? (dont ask why is there a sky under the map)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c6/RobloxScreenShot20241018_174444217.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241019004500\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241018 174444217.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241018_174444217.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:RobloxScreenShot20241018_174444217.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><s>Under the map sky? (dont ask why is there a sky under the map)</s></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Under the map is a floor that has the default sand texture usually, and the skybox and music will still change depending on what area you are in.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 181px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png/revision/latest?cb=20241020133431\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Red fish under map\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"181\" height=\"92\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Знімок екрана 2024-10-12 143811.png\" data-image-key=\"%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/181?cb=20241020133431\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png/revision/latest?cb=20241020133431\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Red fish under map\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/181?cb=20241020133431\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"181\" height=\"92\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Знімок екрана 2024-10-12 143811.png\" data-image-key=\"%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/181?cb=20241020133431\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0_2024-10-12_143811.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Red fish under map</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><big><b>Magma cave</b></big>\n</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 268px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Under_the_maop_magma.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023204658\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The small slot of ground under magma cave\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"268\" height=\"151\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Under the maop magma.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_the_maop_magma.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Under_the_maop_magma.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241023204658\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Under_the_maop_magma.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023204658\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The small slot of ground under magma cave\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Under_the_maop_magma.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241023204658\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"268\" height=\"151\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Under the maop magma.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_the_maop_magma.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Under_the_maop_magma.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241023204658\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Under_the_maop_magma.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The small slot of ground under magma cave</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><s>its hard to find a area under magma cave that actually has ground but a small area has been found the image is below this text</s>\n</p><p>you can go under the map in the magma caves by jumping into the lava in some areas of the cave or going into the lava waterfall in the middle of the raffina caldera shop.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Emberbane_cave.2Fruins\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Emberbane_cave/ruins\">Emberbane cave/ruins</span></h3>\n<p>Another way to get under the map is to get to the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">emberbane ruins</a> and get in the hole under the entrance after you bomb it.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902155603\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3416-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902155603 and revision id 18401. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Emberbane","exists":true}],"images":["Under_the_map_light.png","Under_the_map_magma.png","RobloxScreenShot20241018_174444217.png","Знімок_екрана_2024-10-12_143811.png","Under_the_maop_magma.png"]}
